;padding:0 24px}\\n.aa-legal-meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:26px}\\n.aa-legal-meta span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--aa-dim);background:var(--aa-cont);border:1px solid var(--aa-line2);border-radius:8px;padding:6px 11px}\\n.aa-legal-meta .aa-ms{font-size:15px;color:var(--aa-goldbg)}\\n.aa-tldr{background:var(--aa-low);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,.45);border-radius:14px;padding:24px 26px;margin-bottom:34px}\\n.aa-tldr h3{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;color:var(--aa-gold);font-size:14px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 14px}\\n.aa-tldr h3 .aa-ms{font-size:18px}\\n.aa-tldr ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:9px}\\n.aa-tldr li{display:flex;gap:10px;color:var(--aa-tx);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7}\\n.aa-tldr li .aa-ms{font-size:17px;color:var(--aa-goldbg);flex:none;margin-top:2px}\\n.aa-prose h2{color:var(--aa-gold);font-size:21px;font-weight:700;margin:40px 0 14px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--aa-line)}\\n.aa-prose h2:first-child{border-top:0;padding-top:0;margin-top:0}\\n.aa-prose p{color:#b9bcc8;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;margin:0 0 14px}\\n.aa-prose ul{list-style:none;margin:0 0 16px;padding:0;display:grid;gap:9px}\\n.aa-prose ul li{display:flex;gap:10px;color:#b9bcc8;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.75}\\n.aa-prose ul li .aa-ms{font-size:16px;color:var(--aa-goldbg);flex:none;margin-top:3px}\\n.aa-prose strong{color:var(--aa-tx)}\\n.aa-prose a{color:var(--aa-gold)!important;font-weight:600}\\n.aa-legal-related{max-width:880px;margin:44px auto 0;padding:26px 24px;border-top:1px solid var(--aa-line);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}\\n.aa-legal-related a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--aa-cont);border:1px solid var(--aa-line2);border-radius:10px;padding:9px 15px;color:var(--aa-tx)!important;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none!important}\\n.aa-legal-related a:hover{border-color:var(--aa-gold);color:var(--aa-gold)!important}\\n.aa-legal-related .aa-ms{font-size:16px;color:var(--aa-goldbg)}\\n<\\/style><section class=\\\"aa-legal\\\"><div class=\\\"aa-legal-in\\\"><div class=\\\"aa-legal-meta\\\"><span><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">event<\\/span>Last updated: November 15, 2026<\\/span><span><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">shield<\\/span>Annaadhya Ebooks<\\/span><\\/div><div class=\\\"aa-tldr\\\">\\n\\t<h3><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">bolt<\\/span>The short version<\\/h3>\\n\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">check<\\/span>We collect only what we need to deliver your ebooks: your name, email and order details.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">check<\\/span>We never sell your personal data &mdash; to anyone, ever.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">check<\\/span>Payments run through a PCI-DSS compliant gateway; we never see or store your card or UPI credentials.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">check<\\/span>You can ask for a copy or deletion of your data at any time via support@annaadhya.com.<\\/li>\\n\\t<\\/ul>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"aa-prose\\\">\\n\\t<h2>1. Who we are<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>Annaadhya Ebooks (&ldquo;we&rdquo;, &ldquo;us&rdquo;) operates the online ebook store at annaadhya.com. This policy explains what personal data we collect when you use the store, why we collect it, and the choices you have. It is written to comply with India&rsquo;s <strong>Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023<\\/strong> (&ldquo;DPDP Act&rdquo;).<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>2. What we collect<\\/h2>\\n\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">person<\\/span><span><strong>Account data:<\\/strong> your name and email address, created when you sign up or check out.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">shopping_bag<\\/span><span><strong>Order data:<\\/strong> the ebooks you buy, order numbers, amounts paid and delivery status.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">devices<\\/span><span><strong>Technical data:<\\/strong> browser type, device category and download events, used to keep delivery fast and fix problems.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">mail<\\/span><span><strong>Newsletter data:<\\/strong> your email address, if you choose to subscribe to weekly summaries and discounts.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\n\\t<h2>3. How we use it<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>We process your data to create and maintain your account, deliver your purchases, provide support, prevent fraudulent orders, and &mdash; only with your consent &mdash; send you the newsletter. We do not use your data for profiling that has legal effects on you.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>4. Payments and financial data<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>All payments are processed by our PCI-DSS compliant payment gateway. Your card numbers, UPI IDs and bank credentials go directly to the gateway and are <strong>never stored on our servers<\\/strong>. We retain only the payment status and a gateway reference number for your order.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>5. Cookies<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>We use a small number of essential cookies to keep you signed in, remember your cart and keep download sessions secure. These cannot be switched off without breaking checkout. We do not run third-party advertising trackers.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>6. Who we share data with<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>Your data is shared only with: our payment gateway (to take payments), our email service provider (to deliver order emails and the newsletter), and our hosting provider (to run the store). We never sell or rent personal data. We may disclose data if required by Indian law.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>7. How long we keep it<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>Order and payment records are retained for 8 years as required by Indian tax law. Account data is kept while your account is active. Newsletter data is deleted within 30 days of unsubscribing.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>8. Your rights<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>Under the DPDP Act you may: request a copy of your data; ask us to correct it; ask us to erase it (unless tax law requires us to keep order records); and withdraw newsletter consent with one click. Write to <a href=\\\"mailto:support@annaadhya.com\\\">support@annaadhya.com<\\/a> and we will respond within 30 days.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>9. Children<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>Our store is not directed at children under 18. If you believe a minor created an account with us, contact us and we will remove it.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>10. Security<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>The store runs entirely over HTTPS with 256-bit encryption, hardened download links that expire, and access controls on our admin systems. No system is perfectly secure, but we treat your data with the same care we would want for our own purchases.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>11. Changes to this policy<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>If we change this policy materially, we will update the &ldquo;last updated&rdquo; date above and, for significant changes, notify newsletter subscribers by email.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>12. Grievance officer<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>Per the DPDP Act, our grievance officer can be reached at <a href=\\\"mailto:support@annaadhya.com\\\">support@annaadhya.com<\\/a> with the subject line &ldquo;Privacy grievance&rdquo;. We acknowledge every complaint within 72 hours and aim to resolve it within 30 days.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"aa-legal-related\\\"><a href=\\\"\\/privacy-policy\\/\\\"><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">shield<\\/span>Privacy Policy<\\/a><a href=\\\"\\/terms\\/\\\"><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">description<\\/span>Terms &amp; Conditions<\\/a><a href=\\\"\\/refund-policy\\/\\\"><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">currency_rupee<\\/span>Refund Policy<\\/a><a href=\\\"\\/digital-delivery-policy\\/\\\"><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">cloud_download<\\/span>Digital Delivery<\\/a><a href=\\\"\\/copyright-policy\\/\\\"><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">copyright<\\/span>Copyright Policy<\\/a><\\/div><\\/section>\"},\"elements\":[]}]}]},{\"id\":\"aa310067\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"gap\":\"no\",\"structure\":\"10\",\"stretch_section\":\"section-stretched\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"ab320067\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"ac330067\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"widgetType\":\"html\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<style>\\n.aa-footer{background:var(--aa-bg);border-top:1px solid var(--aa-line);padding:64px 0 32px}\\n.aa-fgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.8fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:34px;margin-bottom:48px}\\n@media(max-width:1024px){.aa-fgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr}}\\n@media(max-width:900px){.aa-fgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}\\n@media(max-width:560px){.aa-fgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n.aa-fbrand-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:6px}\\n.aa-fbrand-row .aa-brand-ic{width:34px;height:34px}\\n.aa-fbrand-row .aa-brand-ic .aa-ms{font-size:19px}\\n.aa-fbrand-name{color:var(--aa-gold);font-weight:700;font-size:18px}\\n.aa-fbrand p{color:var(--aa-dim);font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;max-width:380px;margin:14px 0 20px}\\n.aa-paychips{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\\n.aa-paychips span{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;color:#a08e7a;background:var(--aa-cont);border:1px solid var(--aa-line2);border-radius:6px;padding:5px 9px}\\n.aa-fgrid h4{color:var(--aa-gold);font-size:16px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 16px}\\n.aa-fgrid ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:10px}\\n.aa-fgrid ul a{color:var(--aa-dim)!important;text-decoration:none!important;font-size:14px;transition:color .15s}\\n.aa-fgrid ul a:hover{color:var(--aa-gold)!important}\\n.aa-fbottom{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--aa-line);padding-top:28px}\\n.aa-fsocial{display:flex;gap:10px}\\n.aa-fsocial a{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--aa-cont);border:1px solid var(--aa-line2)