x;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:26px}\\n.aa-legal-meta span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--aa-dim);background:var(--aa-cont);border:1px solid var(--aa-line2);border-radius:8px;padding:6px 11px}\\n.aa-legal-meta .aa-ms{font-size:15px;color:var(--aa-goldbg)}\\n.aa-tldr{background:var(--aa-low);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,.45);border-radius:14px;padding:24px 26px;margin-bottom:34px}\\n.aa-tldr h3{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;color:var(--aa-gold);font-size:14px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 14px}\\n.aa-tldr h3 .aa-ms{font-size:18px}\\n.aa-tldr ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:9px}\\n.aa-tldr li{display:flex;gap:10px;color:var(--aa-tx);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7}\\n.aa-tldr li .aa-ms{font-size:17px;color:var(--aa-goldbg);flex:none;margin-top:2px}\\n.aa-prose h2{color:var(--aa-gold);font-size:21px;font-weight:700;margin:40px 0 14px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--aa-line)}\\n.aa-prose h2:first-child{border-top:0;padding-top:0;margin-top:0}\\n.aa-prose p{color:#b9bcc8;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;margin:0 0 14px}\\n.aa-prose ul{list-style:none;margin:0 0 16px;padding:0;display:grid;gap:9px}\\n.aa-prose ul li{display:flex;gap:10px;color:#b9bcc8;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.75}\\n.aa-prose ul li .aa-ms{font-size:16px;color:var(--aa-goldbg);flex:none;margin-top:3px}\\n.aa-prose strong{color:var(--aa-tx)}\\n.aa-prose a{color:var(--aa-gold)!important;font-weight:600}\\n.aa-legal-related{max-width:880px;margin:44px auto 0;padding:26px 24px;border-top:1px solid var(--aa-line);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}\\n.aa-legal-related a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--aa-cont);border:1px solid var(--aa-line2);border-radius:10px;padding:9px 15px;color:var(--aa-tx)!important;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none!important}\\n.aa-legal-related a:hover{border-color:var(--aa-gold);color:var(--aa-gold)!important}\\n.aa-legal-related .aa-ms{font-size:16px;color:var(--aa-goldbg)}\\n<\\/style><section class=\\\"aa-legal\\\"><div class=\\\"aa-legal-in\\\"><div class=\\\"aa-legal-meta\\\"><span><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">event<\\/span>Last updated: November 15, 2026<\\/span><span><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">currency_rupee<\\/span>Annaadhya Ebooks<\\/span><\\/div><div class=\\\"aa-tldr\\\">\\n\\t<h3><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">bolt<\\/span>The short version<\\/h3>\\n\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">check<\\/span>Download failed or file is broken? <strong>Full refund<\\/strong> &mdash; just tell us within 7 days.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">check<\\/span>Charged twice by accident? The duplicate charge is refunded in full, no questions asked.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">check<\\/span>Refunds land back on your original payment method in 5&ndash;7 business days.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">check<\\/span>Ebooks that download successfully can&rsquo;t be &ldquo;returned&rdquo; &mdash; that&rsquo;s the nature of digital goods.<\\/li>\\n\\t<\\/ul>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"aa-prose\\\">\\n\\t<h2>1. The nature of digital goods<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>An ebook cannot be packed up and posted back. Once a download succeeds, the product has been delivered and consumed in the legal sense. That is why our refund policy focuses on one thing: <strong>making sure every purchase actually works<\\/strong>. Our sample chapters exist precisely so you never buy blind.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>2. The 7-day download guarantee<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>If your download fails repeatedly, the file is corrupted, or the content does not match the description, contact us within <strong>7 days of purchase<\\/strong> with your order number. We will first try to fix delivery; if we cannot, you receive a <strong>full refund<\\/strong> &mdash; no forms, no hoops.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>3. Duplicate and failed payments<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>Accidentally paid twice, or money left your account without an order being created? This is a gateway or network hiccup, not a sale. Report it within 7 days and we refund the full duplicate amount. If a payment shows &ldquo;pending&rdquo; for more than 24 hours with no order, the gateway auto-reverses it; if it does not, we chase it for you.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>4. What is not refundable<\\/h2>\\n\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">close<\\/span><span>Successful downloads where you simply changed your mind &mdash; please read the free sample chapter before buying.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">close<\\/span><span>Requests made after the 7-day window, unless a defect appears later (see section 5).<\\/span><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">close<\\/span><span>Account-level issues caused by sharing your credentials with others.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\n\\t<h2>5. Defects discovered later<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>If a file proves unreadable on a supported device long after purchase (a broken PDF, missing pages), that is a defect, not a preference &mdash; and defects are always fixed or refunded, whatever the calendar says.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>6. How to request a refund<\\/h2>\\n\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">mail<\\/span><span>Use the <a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/\\\">Contact &amp; Support<\\/a> form (topic &ldquo;Refund request&rdquo;) or email support@annaadhya.com.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">receipt_long<\\/span><span>Include your order number and, for download issues, your device and browser.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">check<\\/span><span>We acknowledge within 24 hours and complete most cases within one working day.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\n\\t<h2>7. Refund processing time<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>Approved refunds are initiated within 2 business days and typically appear on your original payment method within <strong>5&ndash;7 business days<\\/strong>, depending on your bank or UPI provider. We refund to the same instrument you paid with &mdash; never to a different account.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>8. Please talk to us before disputing<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>Chargebacks are slow and costly for everyone, including you. If something went wrong, one message usually fixes it faster than a bank dispute. That said, if you must dispute, your consumer rights under Indian law are unaffected.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>9. Contact<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>Refund questions: <a href=\\\"mailto:support@annaadhya.com\\\">support@annaadhya.com<\\/a> or the <a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/\\\">Contact &amp; Support<\\/a> page. Related reading: <a href=\\\"\\/digital-delivery-policy\\/\\\">Digital Product Delivery Policy<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"aa-legal-related\\\"><a href=\\\"\\/privacy-policy\\/\\\"><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">shield<\\/span>Privacy Policy<\\/a><a href=\\\"\\/terms\\/\\\"><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">description<\\/span>Terms &amp; Conditions<\\/a><a href=\\\"\\/refund-policy\\/\\\"><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">currency_rupee<\\/span>Refund Policy<\\/a><a href=\\\"\\/digital-delivery-policy\\/\\\"><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">cloud_download<\\/span>Digital Delivery<\\/a><a href=\\\"\\/copyright-policy\\/\\\"><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">copyright<\\/span>Copyright Policy<\\/a><\\/div><\\/section>\"},\"elements\":[]}]}]},{\"id\":\"aa310067\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"gap\":\"no\",\"structure\":\"10\",\"stretch_section\":\"section-stretched\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"ab320067\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"ac330067\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"widgetType\":\"html\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<style>\\n.aa-footer{background:var(--aa-bg);border-top:1px solid var(--aa-line);padding:64px 0 32px}\\n.aa-fgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.8fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:34px;margin-botto