a{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:26px}\\n.aa-legal-meta span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--aa-dim);background:var(--aa-cont);border:1px solid var(--aa-line2);border-radius:8px;padding:6px 11px}\\n.aa-legal-meta .aa-ms{font-size:15px;color:var(--aa-goldbg)}\\n.aa-tldr{background:var(--aa-low);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,.45);border-radius:14px;padding:24px 26px;margin-bottom:34px}\\n.aa-tldr h3{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;color:var(--aa-gold);font-size:14px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 14px}\\n.aa-tldr h3 .aa-ms{font-size:18px}\\n.aa-tldr ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:9px}\\n.aa-tldr li{display:flex;gap:10px;color:var(--aa-tx);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7}\\n.aa-tldr li .aa-ms{font-size:17px;color:var(--aa-goldbg);flex:none;margin-top:2px}\\n.aa-prose h2{color:var(--aa-gold);font-size:21px;font-weight:700;margin:40px 0 14px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--aa-line)}\\n.aa-prose h2:first-child{border-top:0;padding-top:0;margin-top:0}\\n.aa-prose p{color:#b9bcc8;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;margin:0 0 14px}\\n.aa-prose ul{list-style:none;margin:0 0 16px;padding:0;display:grid;gap:9px}\\n.aa-prose ul li{display:flex;gap:10px;color:#b9bcc8;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.75}\\n.aa-prose ul li .aa-ms{font-size:16px;color:var(--aa-goldbg);flex:none;margin-top:3px}\\n.aa-prose strong{color:var(--aa-tx)}\\n.aa-prose a{color:var(--aa-gold)!important;font-weight:600}\\n.aa-legal-related{max-width:880px;margin:44px auto 0;padding:26px 24px;border-top:1px solid var(--aa-line);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}\\n.aa-legal-related a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--aa-cont);border:1px solid var(--aa-line2);border-radius:10px;padding:9px 15px;color:var(--aa-tx)!important;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none!important}\\n.aa-legal-related a:hover{border-color:var(--aa-gold);color:var(--aa-gold)!important}\\n.aa-legal-related .aa-ms{font-size:16px;color:var(--aa-goldbg)}\\n<\\/style><section class=\\\"aa-legal\\\"><div class=\\\"aa-legal-in\\\"><div class=\\\"aa-legal-meta\\\"><span><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">event<\\/span>Last updated: November 15, 2026<\\/span><span><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">copyright<\\/span>Annaadhya Ebooks<\\/span><\\/div><div class=\\\"aa-tldr\\\">\\n\\t<h3><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">bolt<\\/span>The short version<\\/h3>\\n\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">check<\\/span>Every ebook is owned by its author or Annaadhya &mdash; your purchase buys a personal reading license.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">check<\\/span>Personal use means: read on your devices, make a personal backup. Nothing else.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">check<\\/span>Uploading, reselling or file-sharing our ebooks is copyright infringement.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">check<\\/span>Report piracy and we act within 48 hours &mdash; takedown notices are honored the same way.<\\/li>\\n\\t<\\/ul>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"aa-prose\\\">\\n\\t<h2>1. Ownership<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>All ebooks sold on Annaadhya are protected by copyright under the <strong>Indian Copyright Act, 1957<\\/strong> and international conventions. Rights in each title belong to its author or to Annaadhya Ebooks under a publishing agreement. The Annaadhya name, logo and store design are our intellectual property.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>2. What your purchase licenses<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>Buying an ebook grants you a personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable (only for breach) license to:<\\/p>\\n\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">check<\\/span><span>Read the ebook on any of your personal devices.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">check<\\/span><span>Keep a personal backup copy in case a device dies.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">check<\\/span><span>Print a single copy for personal reading, if you prefer paper.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\n\\t<h2>3. What it does not license<\\/h2>\\n\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">close<\\/span><span>Sharing files with others, uploading them to file-sharing or AI-training services, or reselling them.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">close<\\/span><span>Classroom, library or corporate distribution &mdash; those need a separate license; write to us, we make them affordable.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">close<\\/span><span>Removing, obscuring or altering any copyright or watermark notice in the files.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">close<\\/span><span>Extracting content to create derivative works without written permission.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\n\\t<h2>4. Reporting piracy<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>If you find Annaadhya ebooks on a piracy site, Telegram channel, or a file-sharing link, tell us at <a href=\\\"mailto:support@annaadhya.com\\\">support@annaadhya.com<\\/a> with the subject &ldquo;Piracy report&rdquo; and the link. Every report is acted on within <strong>48 hours<\\/strong>. Our authors &mdash; many of them independent writers &mdash; thank you personally for each one.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>5. Takedown and infringement notices<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>If you believe any content on our store infringes your copyright, send a notice including: your name and contact, identification of the work, the exact URL on our store, and a statement of good-faith belief made under penalty of perjury (per section 52 of the Copyright Act and international DMCA-equivalent practice). Send it to <a href=\\\"mailto:support@annaadhya.com\\\">support@annaadhya.com<\\/a> with the subject &ldquo;Copyright takedown&rdquo;. Valid notices are actioned within <strong>48 hours<\\/strong>; the affected party is notified and may file a counter-notice.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>6. Author rights and disputes<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>Authors published on Annaadhya retain copyright in their works and receive transparent reporting of sales. If you are an author with a dispute about a title, contact us with the subject &ldquo;Author rights&rdquo; &mdash; the grievance is reviewed by someone senior, not by the support queue.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>7. Enforcement<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>We reserve the right to suspend accounts engaged in redistribution and to pursue infringement through appropriate legal remedies. Reporting piracy is not an obligation of ours alone &mdash; it is how independent Indian publishing stays alive.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>8. Contact<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>Copyright questions: <a href=\\\"mailto:support@annaadhya.com\\\">support@annaadhya.com<\\/a> or the <a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/\\\">Contact &amp; Support<\\/a> page.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"aa-legal-related\\\"><a href=\\\"\\/privacy-policy\\/\\\"><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">shield<\\/span>Privacy Policy<\\/a><a href=\\\"\\/terms\\/\\\"><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">description<\\/span>Terms &amp; Conditions<\\/a><a href=\\\"\\/refund-policy\\/\\\"><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">currency_rupee<\\/span>Refund Policy<\\/a><a href=\\\"\\/digital-delivery-policy\\/\\\"><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">cloud_download<\\/span>Digital Delivery<\\/a><a href=\\\"\\/copyright-policy\\/\\\"><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">copyright<\\/span>Copyright Policy<\\/a><\\/div><\\/section>\"},\"elements\":[]}]}]},{\"id\":\"aa310067\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"gap\":\"no\",\"structure\":\"10\",\"stretch_section\":\"section-stretched\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"ab320067\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"ac330067\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"widgetType\":\"html\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<style>\\n.aa-footer{background:var(--aa-bg);border-top:1px solid var(--aa-line);padding:64px 0 32px}\\n.aa-fgrid{display:grid;