rsion<\\/h3>\\n\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">check<\\/span>Ebooks are licensed for <strong>personal use<\\/strong> &mdash; read them anywhere, share them with no one.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">check<\\/span>Delivery is instant: a secure download link the moment your payment clears.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">check<\\/span>Prices are in INR and include GST where applicable.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">check<\\/span>Refunds follow our Refund Policy; disputes are governed by Indian law.<\\/li>\\n\\t<\\/ul>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"aa-prose\\\">\\n\\t<h2>1. Acceptance of these terms<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>By browsing, creating an account, or purchasing on annaadhya.com you agree to these Terms &amp; Conditions. If you do not agree, please do not use the store. These terms are an electronic record under the <strong>Information Technology Act, 2000<\\/strong> and do not require any physical or digital signature.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>2. The service<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>Annaadhya Ebooks sells digital books (PDF) for instant download. We do not ship physical goods. We may add formats, titles and features over time; the store description at the time of your order is the definitive description of what you are buying.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>3. Accounts<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>You agree to give accurate information when creating an account and to keep your credentials confidential. You must be 18 or older, or have the consent of a parent or guardian, to purchase. You are responsible for activity that happens under your account &mdash; tell us immediately if you suspect unauthorized access.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>4. Purchases, pricing and delivery<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>Prices are displayed in Indian Rupees and include GST where applicable. We may change prices at any time, but the price shown at the moment you place your order is the price you pay. Delivery happens electronically: the moment payment is confirmed, your download becomes available in <strong>My Library<\\/strong> and by email. Delivery terms are detailed in our <a href=\\\"\\/digital-delivery-policy\\/\\\">Digital Product Delivery Policy<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>5. Your license to the ebooks<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>When you buy an ebook, you receive a personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable license to read it. You may keep copies on your own devices for personal reading. You may <strong>not<\\/strong> share, resell, sublicense, upload, broadcast or redistribute the files, in whole or in part. Full usage rules live in our <a href=\\\"\\/copyright-policy\\/\\\">Copyright Policy<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>6. Acceptable use<\\/h2>\\n\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">block<\\/span><span>Do not misuse the store: no attempts to breach security, scrape content, disrupt service, or make fraudulent payments.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">block<\\/span><span>Do not use purchased files for training datasets, commercial lending, or classroom distribution without a written license from us.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">block<\\/span><span>Do not misrepresent authorship of any submission you send us.<\\/span><\\/li>\\n\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\n\\t<h2>7. Availability and changes<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>We aim for 24&times;7 availability but the store may be briefly unavailable for maintenance or reasons beyond our control. We may add, change or retire features; if a purchased ebook becomes unavailable we will provide a replacement or a refund under our Refund Policy.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>8. Intellectual property<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>The Annaadhya name, the store design, and all ebooks are protected by copyright. All rights not expressly granted to you in section 5 are reserved.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>9. Limitation of liability<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, our total liability for any claim related to a purchase is limited to the amount you paid for that order. We are not liable for indirect or consequential losses. Nothing in these terms limits liability that cannot be limited under Indian law.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>10. Governing law and disputes<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>These terms are governed by the laws of India. Courts at Bengaluru, Karnataka have exclusive jurisdiction over any dispute. We ask you to contact support first &mdash; nearly everything can be resolved with a conversation.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>11. Changes to these terms<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>We will update the date at the top of this page when these terms change. Continued use of the store after a change means you accept the updated terms.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>12. Contact<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>Questions about these terms: <a href=\\\"mailto:support@annaadhya.com\\\">support@annaadhya.com<\\/a> or through the <a href=\\\"\\/contact\\/\\\">Contact &amp; Support<\\/a> page.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"aa-legal-related\\\"><a href=\\\"\\/privacy-policy\\/\\\"><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">shield<\\/span>Privacy Policy<\\/a><a href=\\\"\\/terms\\/\\\"><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">description<\\/span>Terms &amp; Conditions<\\/a><a href=\\\"\\/refund-policy\\/\\\"><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">currency_rupee<\\/span>Refund Policy<\\/a><a href=\\\"\\/digital-delivery-policy\\/\\\"><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">cloud_download<\\/span>Digital Delivery<\\/a><a href=\\\"\\/copyright-policy\\/\\\"><span class=\\\"aa-ms\\\">copyright<\\/span>Copyright Policy<\\/a><\\/div><\\/section>\"},\"elements\":[]}]}]},{\"id\":\"aa310067\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"gap\":\"no\",\"structure\":\"10\",\"stretch_section\":\"section-stretched\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"ab320067\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"ac330067\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"widgetType\":\"html\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"\\n.aa-footer{background:var(--aa-bg);border-top:1px solid var(--aa-line);padding:64px 0 32px}\\n.aa-fgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.8fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:34px;margin-bottom:48px}\\n@media(max-width:1024px){.aa-fgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr}}\\n@media(max-width:900px){.aa-fgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}\\n@media(max-width:560px){.aa-fgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n.aa-fbrand-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:6px}\\n.aa-fbrand-row .aa-brand-ic{width:34px;height:34px}\\n.aa-fbrand-row .aa-brand-ic .aa-ms{font-size:19px}\\n.aa-fbrand-name{color:var(--aa-gold);font-weight:700;font-size:18px}\\n.aa-fbrand p{color:var(--aa-dim);font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;max-width:380px;margin:14px 0 20px}\\n.aa-paychips{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\\n.aa-paychips span{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;color:#a08e7a;background:var(--aa-cont);border:1px solid var(--aa-line2);border-radius:6px;padding:5px 9px}\\n.aa-fgrid h4{color:var(--aa-gold);font-size:16px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 16px}\\n.aa-fgrid ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:10px}\\n.aa-fgrid ul a{color:var(--aa-dim)!important;text-decoration:none!important;font-size:14px;transition:color .15s}\\n.aa-fgrid ul a:hover{color:var(--aa-gold)!important}\\n.aa-fbottom{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--aa-line);padding-top:28px}\\n.aa-fsocial{display:flex;gap:10px}\\n.aa-fsocial a{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--aa-cont);border:1px solid var(--aa-line2);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--aa-dim)!important}\\n.aa-fsocial a:hover{color:var(--aa-gold)!important;border-color:var(--aa-gold)}\\n.aa-fsocial .aa-ms{font-size:18px}\\n.aa-fbottom p{color:var(--aa-dim);font-size:13px;margin:0}\\n.aa-fchips{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}\\n.aa-fchips span{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--aa-dim);background:var(--aa-cont);border:1px solid var(--aa-line2);border-radi